## 🇬🇧 UNDERSTANDING THIS LICENSE (ENGLISH)
This project is open-source, meaning you are free to use, modify, and share it. However, open-source does not mean "free of copyright." The creator still holds the intellectual property rights to this code. 

**What you CAN do:**
- ✅ **Use for free:** You can use this bot for your own server, personal projects, or communities.
- ✅ **Modify:** You can change the code to suit your needs.
- ✅ **Distribute:** You can share your modified version.

**What you MUST do:**
- ⚠️ **Keep the copyright notice:** You must leave the copyright header and this license in all copies or substantial portions of the software. You cannot claim you created the original code.

**Why does this matter?**
Respecting copyright and licensing ensures that developers like us continue to create and share free software. Erasing credits or claiming others' work as your own discourages open-source contributions and violates the terms of this license.

